{"t":"CMG","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","employees":140000,"hq":"Newport Beach, CA, United States","website":"https://www.chipotle.com","summary_en":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, owns and operates Chipotle Mexican Grill restaurants. The company sells food and beverages, such as burritos, burrito bowls, quesadillas, tacos, and salads, as well as kids' meals, chips, and sides. It also offers Mexican-inspired meals using responsibly sourced meats, such as chicken, beef, and pork under the Responsibly Raised brand. In addition, the company provides digital ordering through its website, mobile app, and third-party delivery platforms. It operates in the United States, Canada, France, Germany, Mexico, the Middle East, South Korea, and the United Kingdom. Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Newport Beach, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 Chipotle Mexican Grill 레스토랑을 소유하고 운영합니다. 이 회사는 부리토, 부리또 볼, 퀘사디아, 타코, 샐러드 등의 음식과 음료는 물론 어린이 식사, 칩, 사이드 메뉴도 판매합니다. 또한 책임감 있게 기른 브랜드로 닭고기, 쇠고기, 돼지고기 등 책임감 있게 조달된 고기를 사용하여 멕시코식 식사를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 웹사이트, 모바일 앱, 제3자 배송 플랫폼을 통해 디지털 주문을 제공합니다. 미국, 캐나다, 프랑스, ​​독일, 한국, 영국에서 운영됩니다. Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc.는 1993년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 뉴포트 비치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":37.345,"mcap":47240491008.0,"pe":34.901867,"fpe":28.219835,"peg":1.8244,"ps":3.7157805,"pb":19.240084,"ev_ebitda":23.0,"div":0.0,"beta":0.986,"hi52":41.42,"lo52":27.31},"fin":{"rev":12713477120.0,"rev_g":0.096,"eps_g":-0.062,"gross":0.39314,"op":0.14715,"net":0.10832,"roe":0.48518002,"fcf":1184089728.0,"cash":902563968.0,"debt":5599030784.0,"de":228.053,"eps":1.07,"feps":1.32336},"own":{"short":0.0292,"inst":0.92019,"insider":0.0076800003},"analyst":{"n":31,"mean":40.64516,"median":40.0,"high":53.0,"low":32.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.82857,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m